~Q
    [ EH ] Edit Msg Header.
    [  F ] Forward Msg to another user.
    [  L ] Lock a Message from Deletion.
    [  P ] Put/Save Msg to a path&filename
    [ TA ] Trace the author.
    [  ! ] Edit users account.

    [  # ] Jump to a particular Message.
    [  + ] Forward Message Read.
    [  - ] Backward Message Read.
    [  A ] Read the Message Again.
    [  D ] Delete the Message.
    [  E ] Edit the message.
    [ NS ] Non-Stop Message Read.
    [  Q ] Quit Reading or Skip to Next Area durring Global Reading.
    [  R ] Reply to Message.
    [  S ] Scan Message Headers.
    [ TM ] Touch Msg and return it to unread status.
    [  X ] Xfer (Download Current Msg)
[ RETURN ] Next Message to be read.

